{"id":"profundamente","lemma":"profundamente","pos":"adv","rank":2119,"glosses":["profoundly, deeply"],"ipa":"/pɾoˌfundaˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Ahora, respira profundamente.","en":"Now, take a deep breath.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606629","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to breathe","l":"respirar"},null]},{"text":"Él no podía respirar profundamente.","en":"He could not breathe deeply.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639183","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to breathe"},null]},{"text":"Encontré al chico profundamente dormido.","en":"I found the boy sound asleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333131","words":[{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"boy"},null,{"g":"asleep, sleeping"}]},{"text":"Él estaba profundamente dormido.","en":"He was fast asleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450412","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"asleep, sleeping"}]},{"text":"Estoy profundamente enamorado de ti.","en":"I'm deeply in love with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767727","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"infatuated"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]}]}